Package: maxmindesign
Title: Max-Min Experimental Designs for Pairwise Treatment Comparisons with Binary Outcomes
Version: 1.2.2
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lunganlung", "P. G.", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "lunganlungpg@gmail.com"))
Description: Power and sample-size tools for max-min optimal allocations when
    pairs of treatments with binary (success/failure) outcomes are compared,
    following Singh and Davidov (2026) <doi:10.1016/j.jspi.2025.106379>.
    Provides the Wald-test non-centrality parameter, chi-square power,
    largest-remainder integer allocation, degree-based max-min allocations for
    bipartite comparison graphs, minimum sample-size search, and replications
    of the paper's seedling-emergence case study and simulation benchmark.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/Max-min-Design
BugReports: https://github.com/lunganlungpg/Max-min-Design/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
